{
  "pid": "self-hard-02",
  "source": "selfmade",
  "difficulty": "hard",
  "title": "批次工艺阶段与运行时长统计（无外部时钟）",
  "requirements": "写一个功能块 FB，管理间歇反应釜批次。初始 (phase, elapsed, timeout)=(0,0,FALSE)。\n1. maxDuration 为正整数，单位为扫描拍；所有实数输入为有限值，不使用系统时钟或计时器。\n2. 每拍先记录 startBtn 上升沿，包括中止当拍；按 中止 > 新启动沿 > 运行计数 的优先级处理。\n3. abortBtn 为 TRUE 时立即进入 phase=9，elapsed 与 timeout 保持；同拍启动沿已消耗，重新启动必须松开再按。\n4. 无中止且出现新启动沿时进入 phase=1，elapsed=0、timeout=FALSE；启动拍不计数。\n5. 上一拍 phase 为1或2时先将 elapsed 加1。达到本拍 maxDuration 则 timeout=TRUE、phase=3，优先于升温达标；否则 phase=1 且 pv>=setpoint 时进入 phase=2。\n6. phase=3 为完成态、phase=9 为中止态，两态冻结计数及超时标志，直到新的有效启动或中止。不设无接口支持的操作员确认。",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "startBtn",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "批次开始（上升沿有效）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "abortBtn",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "中止按钮（直接中止批次）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "setpoint",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "工艺设定值",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "pv",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "过程测量值",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "maxDuration",
      "data_type": "INT",
      "description": "本批次允许的最长持续时间（秒）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "elapsed",
      "data_type": "INT",
      "description": "已运行秒数",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "phase",
      "data_type": "INT",
      "description": "阶段号：0=空闲 1=升温 2=保温 3=完成 9=已中止",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "timeout",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "超时标志",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    }
  ],
  "target_pou": "FUNCTION_BLOCK",
  "specs": [
    {
      "sid": "S1",
      "text": "无中止、无新启动沿且上一拍处于运行态时，恰好计数一拍（含完成拍）。",
      "ltl": "G((prev(TRUE) AND prev(phase=1 OR phase=2) AND NOT abortBtn AND NOT (startBtn AND NOT prev(startBtn))) -> elapsed=prev(elapsed)+1)",
      "kind": "sequencing",
      "verified_by": "plcverif"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S2",
      "text": "运行计数达到本拍正时限时进入超时完成态3。",
      "ltl": "G((prev(TRUE) AND prev(phase=1 OR phase=2) AND NOT abortBtn AND NOT (startBtn AND NOT prev(startBtn)) AND maxDuration<=prev(elapsed)+1) -> (timeout AND phase=3))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "plcverif"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S3",
      "text": "中止优先于同拍启动，并冻结计数与超时标志。",
      "ltl": "G(abortBtn -> (phase=9 AND elapsed=prev(elapsed) AND timeout=prev(timeout)))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "plcverif"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S4",
      "text": "完成和中止态在无新启动且无中止时保持。",
      "ltl": "G((prev(TRUE) AND prev(phase=3 OR phase=9) AND NOT abortBtn AND NOT (startBtn AND NOT prev(startBtn))) -> (phase=prev(phase) AND elapsed=prev(elapsed) AND timeout=prev(timeout)))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "plcverif"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S5",
      "text": "仅未中止的新启动沿开始批次并清零，启动拍不计数。",
      "ltl": "G(((startBtn AND NOT prev(startBtn)) AND NOT abortBtn) -> (elapsed=0 AND NOT timeout AND phase=1))",
      "kind": "sequencing",
      "verified_by": "plcverif"
    }
  ],
